# Line endings are behaviour here, not taste.
#
# Two places depend on them:
#  - `scripts/` is imported by the test suite. Vitest's transform rejects a
#    shebang line followed by CRLF ("Invalid or unexpected token"), so a
#    Windows checkout with `core.autocrlf=true` turned a passing suite into a
#    syntax error on files nobody edited.
#  - Tests and acceptance tooling compare exact text in `packages/*/assets`,
#    where a CRLF copy silently fails to match an LF literal.
#
# Everything is text and there are no Windows shell scripts in the repository,
# so the whole tree is pinned to LF and every checkout agrees with CI.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary formats are never converted, whatever the path.
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.png binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.mp4 binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.tgz binary
*.so binary
*.z.so binary
